00:57:45.220 --> 00:57:55.990
<v Ira Glass>Thanks as always to our program's co-founder, Torey Malatia. You know, why does he always look so great? Well, it's because he spends his workdays outside with his computer, no matter what the weather is.
<v Ira Glass>一如既往地感谢我们节目的联合创始人托里·马拉蒂亚。你知道，为什么他总是看起来那么棒？嗯，那是因为他无论天气如何，都把工作时间花在外面用他的电脑。

00:57:55.990 --> 00:58:00.320
<v Giulietta Carrelli>Mostly in a Speedo, tanning, no tanning lotion.
<v Giulietta Carrelli>大多数时候穿着三角泳裤，晒太阳，没有防晒霜。

00:58:00.320 --> 00:58:03.510
